{"seq":1,"slug":"chaos-engineering-practice","title":"混沌工程实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/resilience-engineering-failure-recovery/chaos-engineering-and-disaster-recovery/chaos-engineering-practice","wordCount":1969,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"混沌工程实践\">混沌工程实践</h1><p>2010 年，Netflix 工程师 Greg Orzell 写了一个只做一件事的程序：在工作时间随机杀掉生产环境里的实例，它叫 Chaos Monkey（见 <a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/system-design/what-is-netflixs-chaos-monkey/\">GeeksforGeeks: Netflix Chaos Monkey</a>）。这个看似自毁的动作背后是一个反直觉的判断：与其祈祷故障不发生，不如主动、可控、在白天有人盯着时把它制造出来，逼迫系统在你能从容应对时暴露弱点，而不是在凌晨三点把你叫醒。混沌工程不是「随便搞破坏」，而是一门带假设、带止损、带度量的实验科学——它和上游章节讲的熔断、重试、舱壁是一对孪生：那些是「让系统能扛住故障」的设计，混沌工程是「证明它真的扛得住」的验证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>混沌工程的权威定义来自 <a href=\"https://principlesofchaos.org/\">principlesofchaos.org</a>：在分布式系统上做实验，以建立对系统在湍流条件下仍能正常运行的信心。它的五条核心原则被反复引用（见 <a href=\"https://cloud.google.com/blog/products/devops-sre/getting-started-with-chaos-engineering\">Google Cloud: Getting started with chaos engineering</a>）：定义稳态、提出假设、限制爆炸半径、持续运行、不断学习。整个实验闭环可以用一张图概括：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[定义稳态&lt;br/&gt;steady state] --&gt; B[提出假设&lt;br/&gt;注入故障后稳态不变]&#10;  B --&gt; C[限制爆炸半径&lt;br/&gt;单实例/低流量百分比]&#10;  C --&gt; D[注入真实故障&lt;br/&gt;延迟/杀实例/丢包/资源耗尽]&#10;  D --&gt; E{稳态指标&lt;br/&gt;是否越线?}&#10;  E --&gt;|越线触发止损| F[自动回滚&lt;br/&gt;实验中止]&#10;  E --&gt;|稳态维持| G[假设未被证伪&lt;br/&gt;系统通过]&#10;  F --&gt; H[复盘:发现真实弱点]&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; A\">flowchart TD\n  A[定义稳态&lt;br/&gt;steady state] --&gt; B[提出假设&lt;br/&gt;注入故障后稳态不变]\n  B --&gt; C[限制爆炸半径&lt;br/&gt;单实例/低流量百分比]\n  C --&gt; D[注入真实故障&lt;br/&gt;延迟/杀实例/丢包/资源耗尽]\n  D --&gt; E{稳态指标&lt;br/&gt;是否越线?}\n  E --&gt;|越线触发止损| F[自动回滚&lt;br/&gt;实验中止]\n  E --&gt;|稳态维持| G[假设未被证伪&lt;br/&gt;系统通过]\n  F --&gt; H[复盘:发现真实弱点]\n  G --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; A</pre><p>这五步里，最容易被新手忽略的是「定义稳态」。稳态不是「系统没崩」，而是一个可度量的业务输出：每秒成功下单数、p99 延迟、播放启动成功率。<a href=\"https://www.ibm.com/think/topics/chaos-engineering\">IBM: What is Chaos Engineering</a> 强调，你要先用一个数字描述「正常」长什么样，再假设注入故障后这个数字不会显著偏移。如果连稳态都说不清，实验结果就无从判断成败。</p>\n<p>下面这张表把混沌工程容易被混淆的几个相邻概念区分开：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>关注点</th>\n<th>触发方式</th>\n<th>与混沌工程的关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单元/集成测试</td>\n<td>代码逻辑正确性</td>\n<td>确定性输入</td>\n<td>测「写对没」，不测「故障下行为」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>压力测试</td>\n<td>容量上限</td>\n<td>加大负载</td>\n<td>测「能扛多少量」，不主动制造故障</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混沌工程</td>\n<td>故障下的韧性</td>\n<td>主动注入故障</td>\n<td>测「坏了之后会怎样」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>灾难恢复演练</td>\n<td>区域级失效后的恢复</td>\n<td>模拟整 AZ/Region 失效</td>\n<td>混沌工程的最大爆炸半径形态</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"稳态假设与爆炸半径的数学约束\">稳态假设与爆炸半径的数学约束</h2><p>混沌实验和普通故障的唯一区别，就是「可控」二字，而可控的核心抓手是爆炸半径（blast radius）。<a href=\"https://principlesofchaos.org/\">principlesofchaos.org</a> 与 <a href=\"https://talent500.com/blog/chaos-engineering-resilient-systems/\">Gremlin/Talent500 的实践总结</a> 都给出同一条铁律：从最小开始——单个实例、单个服务、极低百分比的流量——确认止损控制有效后再扩大。</p>\n<p>把它形式化会更清晰。设系统总请求量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>，实验注入故障的流量比例为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，故障导致请求失败的条件概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span>，那么实验引入的额外用户影响期望为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>impact</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{\\text{impact}} = N \\cdot p \\cdot q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">impact</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>第一次实验应当让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 足够小（例如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.01</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p = 0.01</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.01</span></span></span></span></span>，即 1% 流量），使得即便止损失效、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q \\to 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，影响也被限制在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mn>0.01</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N \\cdot 0.01</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.01</span></span></span></span></span> 之内。只有当连续多轮实验的实测影响低于预算阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>budget</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{\\text{budget}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">budget</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时，才允许把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 翻倍。这条「指数试探、线性确认」的扩张曲线，是把「实验」与「事故」分开的那道墙。</p>\n<p>止损的另一半是自动中止。稳态指标 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 若跌破阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_{\\min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，实验必须无条件停止并回滚。判据是一个简单的越线检测：当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m(t) &lt; m_{\\min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 持续时间超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>，触发 stop condition。AWS FIS 正是用 CloudWatch 告警实现这一点——告警定义了「应用性能不可接受」的阈值，实验运行中一旦告警触发，FIS 立即停止实验（见 <a href=\"https://aws.amazon.com/fis/faqs/\">AWS FIS FAQs</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"故障注入的层次与工具选型-2026\">故障注入的层次与工具选型（2026）</h2><p>故障可以注入在不同层次：基础设施（杀实例、断网卡）、平台（耗尽 CPU/内存/磁盘）、应用（注入 HTTP 错误码、人为延迟）。2026 年的工具生态已经相当成熟，<a href=\"https://www.gartner.com/reviews/market/chaos-engineering-tools\">Gartner Peer Insights 的混沌工程工具市场</a> 与 <a href=\"https://slashdot.org/software/chaos-engineering/\">Slashdot 的 2026 工具榜</a> 都把它们分成了几类。下面给出主流选型对照：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>注入层次</th>\n<th>部署形态</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>AWS FIS</td>\n<td>基础设施/平台</td>\n<td>云托管服务</td>\n<td>API 限流、实例终止、网络延迟（<a href=\"https://aws.amazon.com/fis/faqs/\">AWS FIS FAQs</a>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Gremlin</td>\n<td>全层次</td>\n<td>SaaS + Agent</td>\n<td>带爆炸半径控制的企业级实验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LitmusChaos</td>\n<td>平台/应用</td>\n<td>Kubernetes 原生</td>\n<td>K8s 集群里的 Pod/网络故障</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Istio 故障注入</td>\n<td>应用层</td>\n<td>服务网格</td>\n<td>不改代码地注入 HTTP 错误与延迟（<a href=\"https://oneuptime.com/blog/post/2026-02-24-how-to-use-fault-injection-for-chaos-engineering-in-istio/view\">OneUptime</a>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Harness Chaos</td>\n<td>全层次</td>\n<td>平台集成</td>\n<td>带工作流与报告的资源耗尽演练</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Istio 的应用层注入特别适合渐进式入门：<a href=\"https://oneuptime.com/blog/post/2026-02-24-how-to-use-fault-injection-for-chaos-engineering-in-istio/view\">OneUptime 2026-02 的教程</a> 指出，它能在不改业务代码、不动基础设施的前提下，对特定路由甚至特定用户注入 HTTP 错误和延迟。一个最小的 VirtualService 故障注入大致如下：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: networking.istio.io/v1&#10;kind: VirtualService&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: ratings-chaos&#10;spec:&#10;  hosts:&#10;    - ratings&#10;  http:&#10;    - fault:&#10;        delay:&#10;          percentage:&#10;            value: 1.0 # 仅 1% 请求，限制爆炸半径&#10;          fixedDelay: 7s # 注入 7 秒延迟&#10;        abort:&#10;          percentage:&#10;            value: 0.5 # 0.5% 请求直接返回 500&#10;          httpStatus: 500&#10;      route:&#10;        - destination:&#10;            host: ratings\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">networking.istio.io/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">VirtualService</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ratings-chaos</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  hosts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ratings</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  http</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">fault</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        delay</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          percentage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 仅 1% 请求，限制爆炸半径</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          fixedDelay</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">7s</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 注入 7 秒延迟</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        abort</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          percentage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 0.5% 请求直接返回 500</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          httpStatus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">500</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      route</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">destination</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            host</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ratings</span></span></code></pre></div><p>云托管路线则首选 AWS FIS。它的实验模板（experiment template）把动作、目标和止损条件声明在一起，作为故障注入的蓝图；FIS 还提供 target preview，让你在启动前先核对实验究竟会命中哪些资源 ARN，避免「以为只打了测试机、实际打到了生产库」这类爆炸半径失控（见 <a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/fis/latest/userguide/experiment-templates.html\">AWS FIS 实验模板文档</a> 与 <a href=\"https://aws.amazon.com/fis/faqs/\">AWS FIS FAQs</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从-gameday-到持续混沌\">从 GameDay 到持续混沌</h2><p>混沌工程的组织实践有两种节奏。一种是 GameDay：一群人约定一个时间窗，集体在准生产或生产环境制造一次大故障，现场观察并演练响应。它的源头比 Chaos Monkey 还早——2008 到 2010 年，Amazon 的 Jesse Robbins 就在搞「Game Day」，故意搞崩生产系统（见 <a href=\"https://www.techinterview.org/post/3233474125/system-design-chaos-engineering-netflix-chaos-monkey-fault-injection-game-days-resilience-testing-blast-radius/\">Tech Interview Dot Org 的系统设计整理</a>）。GameDay 的价值在于演练「人」：监控告警链路通不通、值班同学知不知道怎么处置、Runbook 是否过期。</p>\n<p>另一种是持续混沌：把实验编进 CI/CD，每次部署后自动跑一批故障注入，把回归自动抓出来。<a href=\"https://www.ciodive.com/spons/the-evolution-of-chaos-engineering-from-chaos-monkey-at-netflix-to-reliabi/814973/\">CIO Dive 对混沌工程演进的梳理</a> 把这描述为「从周期性 GameDay 到能自动捕获回归的持续混沌」的进程。Netflix 的 Simian Army 正是沿这条路线扩张的：Chaos Monkey 杀单实例，Chaos Gorilla 模拟整个可用区失效，Chaos Kong 模拟整个云区域失效（见 <a href=\"https://www.techinterview.org/post/3233474125/system-design-chaos-engineering-netflix-chaos-monkey-fault-injection-game-days-resilience-testing-blast-radius/\">Tech Interview Dot Org</a>）——爆炸半径从一台机器一路放大到一个 Region，正好对应灾难恢复演练。</p>\n<p>2026 年最值得关注的趋势是自动化程度的跃升：<a href=\"https://www.ciodive.com/spons/the-evolution-of-chaos-engineering-from-chaos-monkey-at-netflix-to-reliabi/814973/\">CIO Dive</a> 与多家厂商博客预测，完全自治的混沌工程（由系统自己决定何时、注入什么故障）会在 2026–2028 年间成熟。但即便工具越来越聪明，原则没变：没有稳态定义、没有止损、没有限制爆炸半径的「自动化混沌」，本质上就是自动化事故。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>混沌工程是带假设、带度量、带止损的实验科学，目的是在可控条件下提前暴露弱点，而非随机搞破坏；它验证的正是熔断/重试/舱壁这些韧性设计的真实效果。</li>\n<li>五条核心原则缺一不可：定义可度量的稳态、提出「注入故障后稳态不变」的假设、限制爆炸半径、持续运行、不断学习（<a href=\"https://principlesofchaos.org/\">principlesofchaos.org</a>）。</li>\n<li>爆炸半径要「指数试探、线性确认」：从极小流量比例 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 起步，确认止损有效再翻倍；自动中止依赖稳态指标越线检测，AWS FIS 用 CloudWatch 告警实现 stop condition（<a href=\"https://aws.amazon.com/fis/faqs/\">AWS FIS FAQs</a>）。</li>\n<li>故障可注入在基础设施/平台/应用三层；2026 主流工具按场景选型：AWS FIS（云托管）、Gremlin（企业全层次）、LitmusChaos（K8s 原生）、Istio（应用层免改码）。</li>\n<li>组织节奏从 GameDay（演练人与流程）走向持续混沌（CI/CD 自动抓回归），爆炸半径可从单实例放大到整 Region，与灾难恢复演练接轨；2026–2028 自治化混沌渐成熟，但原则不变。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"混沌工程实践","id":"混沌工程实践"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"稳态假设与爆炸半径的数学约束","id":"稳态假设与爆炸半径的数学约束"},{"level":2,"text":"故障注入的层次与工具选型（2026）","id":"故障注入的层次与工具选型-2026"},{"level":2,"text":"从 GameDay 到持续混沌","id":"从-gameday-到持续混沌"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"自适应并发限制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/resilience-engineering-failure-recovery/backpressure-and-flow-control/adaptive-concurrency-limiting"},"next":{"title":"多区域故障转移","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/resilience-engineering-failure-recovery/chaos-engineering-and-disaster-recovery/multi-region-failover"}}